            <ArticleTitle>Acute hantavirus infection presenting as hypersensitivity vasculitis with arthropathy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>75-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute hantavirus infection was diagnosed in a young man presenting with a hypersensitivity vasculitis and arthropathy. He has recovered with minimal evidence of residual renal damage.</AbstractText>
